Greetings from Team V.A.P.S., the official Sports and Fitness Club of IBS Hyderabad!

We are delighted to invite your esteemed institution to participate in AAVEG 17, our flagship national-level inter-B-school sports fest, scheduled to be held on 20th, 21st, and 22nd November 2026 at IBS Hyderabad.

AAVEG is more than just a sporting event—it is a celebration of sportsmanship, teamwork, competition, and camaraderie, bringing together students from institutions across the country. With an exciting lineup of sporting events, cultural programmes, and a grand Social Night, AAVEG 17 promises three days of thrilling competition, memorable experiences, and vibrant celebrations.

The sporting events planned for AAVEG 17 include:

Cricket | Women's Cricket | Football | Basketball | Volleyball | Throwball | Badminton | Table Tennis | Squash | Lawn Tennis | Chess | Carrom | BGMI | Real Cricket

Alongside the sporting action, participants can look forward to cultural performances, opportunities to connect with students from other institutions, and an exciting Social Night to conclude the celebrations.

We would be honoured to have your institution participate in this edition of AAVEG and be part of an unforgettable sporting experience.

